          "id": "test-1",
          "narration": {
            "text": "Use the squint test. If the two angles look like the same size, they're equal. If one is clearly fat and the other skinny, they're partners that sum to one eighty. Then write one equation, solve it, and plug back in to be sure the angles still make sense.",
